msgid "With this feature, there will be an additional button in the profile section allowing users to upload avatars"
msgstr "启用此功能后，资料部分将增加一个按钮，允许用户上传头像"

msgid "With this feature, you can notify your orders to your Telegram group, helping you manage orders conveniently"
